{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re grabbing a quick bite or settling in for a marathon of unpredictable mazes, <i>Catch That Pizza! Maze Game</i> always serves up a fresh challenge. Perfect for players of all ages, this delightful adventure sends you racing through hedge-lined paths, dodging slippery peels, and snatching fruit bowls for a speed boost\u2014all before savoring delicious pizza!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482410/extras/0a0b7b78934171b750cf70b4aa6ab58c.avif?t=1739520094\" width=384 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RANDOMIZED MAZES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every maze is randomly generated, ensuring a new experience with each run. There are four levels of maze complexity.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482410/extras/3b7004e21fcac3cfcaf007f1a703b3e6.avif?t=1739520094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482410/extras_big/3b7004e21fcac3cfcaf007f1a703b3e6.avif?t=1739520094 width=800 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game again and get a new maze:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482410/extras/68d33081336a53babd04f4f22ce1962b.avif?t=1739520094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482410/extras_big/68d33081336a53babd04f4f22ce1962b.avif?t=1739520094 width=800 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHASE THE MOVING PIZZA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike ordinary maze games, your goal doesn\u2019t sit still. The pizza vanishes and reappears in different spots, keeping you constantly on your toes. Don\u2019t slip on banana peels, and make sure to grab fruit bowls to turbocharge your dash to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482410/extras/513fbeab47ce1f58daa013bdf92f38ba.avif?t=1739520094\" width=256 height=256 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>SELECT YOUR FAVORITE PIZZA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese, pepperoni, or veggie\u2014pick your favorite topping before starting the game. Each level may include multiple pizzas to catch before you can escape. Check your completion time after capturing the pizza(s) and exiting the maze, and see if you can outdo your best record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482410/extras/66de3fc7026055c7c4dfd87f0d9cc9f8.avif?t=1739520094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482410/extras_big/66de3fc7026055c7c4dfd87f0d9cc9f8.avif?t=1739520094 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE HEDGE MAZE EXPERIENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the outdoor ambience as you navigate a lush hedge maze. Hear the crunch of sand beneath your feet, take a breather on soft grass, and listen to the gentle wind rustling flags at the exit. Prepare to indulge in a unique, tasty, and endlessly surprising maze adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla